#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""The supervisor's pause counter, on the agent's PATH so the supervisor skill calls it by name.

The plugin puts this directory on the agent's PATH. The command lives in
`core/supervisor_pause_stats.py`; this file only finds it. Python 3.8 must still parse
this file.
"""

